                                "sense_id": "3cc1b006-7af0-3190-88ad-1d58d11c13e1",
                                "text": "Perhaps linguists have provided a step towards the right solution in presenting evidence from Indo-European kinship terminology that the Indo-Europeans were very much into exogamy, including taking the Eneolithic equivalent of mail-order brides from afar."
                            }
